Scope

The MIT license above covers the source code (HTML, CSS, JavaScript).

It does NOT cover, and all rights are reserved for:
  - the personal content: texts, projects, writeups, certifications
    (assets/data/content.js, assets/js/i18n.js texts), images (assets/img/);
  - the CTF challenge material (assets/ctf/) and its design;
  - the PGP public key (assets/pgp/), which identifies its owner.

Third-party:
  - Fonts in assets/fonts/ (Inter, JetBrains Mono) are under the SIL Open Font
    License 1.1 — see the LICENSE-*.txt files next to them.
